{"strongs": "H1954", "word": "הוֺשֵׁעַ", "translit": "ho.she.a", "root": "הושע", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "salvation", "definition": "הוֺשֵׁעַ proper name, masculine ( salvation ; on form, compare הַשְׁמֵד הַמְשֵׁל on pronunciation see Hpt ZA ii, 261 Anm. 2 Jager BAS i, 468 ) — 1. original name of Joshua according to Num 13:8 ; Num 13:16 ( P ), ᵐ5 Αυση , compare Deut 32:44 ( J ; probably error, see Dr ), ᵐ5 Ιησους , see יְהוֺשׁוּעַ above 2. last king of Israel 2Kgs 15:30 ; 2Kgs 17:1 ; 2Kgs 17:3 ; 2Kgs 17:4 ; 2Kgs 17:6 ; 2Kgs 18:1 ; 2Kgs 18:9 ; 2Kgs 18:10 , ᵐ5 Ωσηε . 3. the prophet Hosea Hos 1:1 ; Hos 1:2 (twice in verse), ᵐ5 Ωσηε . 4. an Ephraimite chief under David 1Chr 27:20 , ᵐ5 Ωση ( ε ). 5. a chief under Nehemiah Neh 10:24 , ᵐ5 Ωσηθα , Ωσηε .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3816')\">BDB3816</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1954')\">H1954</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3815')\">BDB3815</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3817')\">BDB3817</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>הוֺשֵׁעַ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>salvation</highlight>; on form, compare <bdbheb>הַשְׁמֵד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַמְשֵׁל</bdbheb> on pronunciation see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hpt')\">Hpt<sup>ZA ii, 261 Anm. 2</sup></lookup> Jager<sup>BAS i, 468</sup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> original name of Joshua according to <ref ref=\"Num 13:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,8)\">Num 13:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 13:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,16)\">Num 13:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Αυση</grk>, compare <ref ref=\"Deut 32:44\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,44)\">Deut 32:44</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; probably error, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>), <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ιησους</grk>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>יְהוֺשׁוּעַ</reflink></bdbheb> above </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> last king of Israel <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:30\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,30)\">2Kgs 15:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,1)\">2Kgs 17:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,3)\">2Kgs 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,4)\">2Kgs 17:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,6)\">2Kgs 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,1)\">2Kgs 18:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,9)\">2Kgs 18:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,10)\">2Kgs 18:10</ref>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ωσηε</grk>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> the prophet Hosea <ref ref=\"Hos 1:1\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(28,1,1)\">Hos 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 1:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,1,2)\">Hos 1:2</ref> (twice in verse), <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ωσηε</grk>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> an Ephraimite chief under David <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\